<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Sadia Concordia Q1 net jumps.</title>
<headline>Brazil Sadia Concordia Q1 net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian meat processor Sadia Concordia issued the following statement on its first quarter consolidated results.</p>
<p>			 Q1 1997	    Q1 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	 21.9 mln	   7.5 mln</p>
<p>    Total revs	 719 mln	     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation. The company said in a statement that its earnings were up 190.5 percent from the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>Its revenues were up 7.4 percent.</p>
<p>It also said its investments totalled $19.9 million in the first quarter.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
